Hi!

Thanks for the reply!

The paper by Steiner and Verborgh was pretty insightful and interesting! I went through the slides and the Github Repo, and I feel a R package would be pretty useful!

Incidentally, I'm working on a similar project in college -- "Detection of Epidemic Diseases using Twitter". I've written some preliminary, but working code <https://github.com/shubh24/EpidemicDetection/>.

I could start basic research on this topic and prepare an appropriate workplan, if the idea seems appealing and implementable!

Thanks,
Shubhankar Srivastava,
BITS Pilani, India

